OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest introduces live
OL,7,     Fperformance from The Gesualdo Six
OL,8,     Fat London's Wigmore Hall plus
OL,9,     Fhighlights from the recent St
OL,10,     FMagnus Festival on Orkney.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,12,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,13,     FSamuel Barber's early beginnings
OL,14,     Fas a composer during the 1930s.
OL,15,G1700 In Tune
OL,16,     FSean Shibe and Karim Sulayman
OL,17,     Fperform live. Petroc also chats to
OL,18,     FAndrew Griffiths and Jeremy Gray,
OL,19,     Fdiscussing Bampton Classical
OL,20,     FOpera's production of Gretry's
OL,21,     FZemira and Azor.
